B.yi=new A.dt("Hidayatul Quran","Flutter \xb7 Full-stack Firebase","Read and listen to curated Quran books\u2014offline-friendly with a built-in admin CMS.","Hidayatul Quran (com.hidayatul.quran_book) lets users browse categorized Islamic/Quran books with PDF reading, audio listening, bookmarks, search, donations, and profile settings. An admin dashboard manages books, categories, banners, users, donations, and readings. Firebase is the source of truth, with a GitHub + jsDelivr public_data mirror for regions where Firebase is hard to reach.",B.G0,B.G5,B.Ff,4279987018,B.G_,B.K7,"https://github.com/PanMyintMo/quran_book","Live product","2025\u20132026")
B.EW=s(["Bottom tabs: Home (calendar), Appointment list, New Sale, Sales, Clients, More","Syncfusion appointment calendar with multi-service booking","Home FABs: refresh, check-in, new appointment, top-up, new sale","Direct check-in and POS new-sale / sale history flows","Client CRM: wallet/credit, service bag, reminders, birthday & inactivity signals","More \u2192 Clinic: Products, Services, Packages, Practitioners, Top-ups","More \u2192 Management: Leave, Seller, Report","More \u2192 Settings: theme, translate, supported APIs, logout","Inventory: products, brands, stock; clinic form","Firebase messaging / storage; Hive local cache; localization"],t.s)
