B.yf=new A.dt("GT Taskflow","Flutter \xb7 Clinical workflow","Practitioner kanban board\u2014services, check-in/out, medical records, and signatures.","GT Taskflow (gt_taskflow / com.greattime.gtTaskflow) helps clinic practitioners run the day on a drag-and-drop workflow board. Staff add/edit services, select practitioner and room, check members in/out, capture signatures, manage procedures and agreements, and keep member medical context\u2014localized in English, Myanmar, and Thai.",B.Fh,B.Fv,B.Fa,4286331629,B.aW,B.fB,null,"Live product","2025\u20132026")
