B.ya=new A.dt("Flutter Clean Base","Architecture starter","Reusable clean-architecture Flutter base with auth, networking, and device security.","Layered Flutter starter used as a foundation for production clients. Demo flows cover login/register against DummyJSON, user CRUD, and a profile map with geolocation. The core ships Dio interceptors, secure storage, encryption, certificate pinning, root/jailbreak checks, env flavors, RBAC stubs, and Hive caching with Riverpod DI.",B.Fq,B.Fy,B.EV,4281294220,B.aW,B.fB,"https://github.com/PanMyintMo/base_code_flutter","Architecture base","2025")
